@booking = http://localhost:7001

### All shows with free and total seats
GET {{booking}}/shows

### One show with its seat map (rows, cols, every seat with tier, price and status)
GET {{booking}}/shows/SHOW-1

### Unknown show: 404 SHOW_NOT_FOUND
GET {{booking}}/shows/NOPE

### Demo helper: a fresh show (movie and screen from the seeds; prices default to 200.00 / 350.00)
POST {{booking}}/admin/shows
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "DEMO-1", "movieId": "spirited-away", "screenId": "AUDI-2", "regularCents": 12000 }

### Delete it again (seats, holds and bookings go with it)
DELETE {{booking}}/admin/shows/DEMO-1
